  - See the STREAMS <http://www.openss7.org/streams_perf.html>, UDP
    <http://www.openss7.org/udp_perf.html>, TCP
    <http://www.openss7.org/tcp_perf.html> and SCTP
    <http://www.openss7.org/strsctp_perf.html> performance pages for
